{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パシフィコ横浜の個別握手会に来て下さった皆さんありがとうございました\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2EADS91TE0TAY4B2BVXS2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月明けに皆さんと握手をしてとっても楽しかったです☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「三ヶ日みかん箱買いしたよ!」と言って下さった方がとても多くて感激しました(T ^ T)(T ^ T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の大好きな地元の事を沢山の方々に知ってもらえてとても幸せです(●︎´∀︎`●︎)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"因みに私はお正月は三ヶ日みかんを冷凍して食べていました ♪冷凍みかんですね ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2EBVSE0JH1YM3NWF96GTK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを一つずつラップに包んで一気に冷凍庫で冷やします!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイス感覚で手軽に食べられるしとっても美味しいです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも是非試してみて下さい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2EDN92PNAS8EMR6EST0SK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽コーディネート△トップス→Crispジャンスカ→メチャカリ靴→DHOLIC"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2EGA3E4MEQ7XEVVAEN1TC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと思ったんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画質が汚い気がする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これやっぱりiPhone5sだからかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとも私の肌の色のせいかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変えなくていいと思ってたけどカメラに影響出るのは辛いなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春になるし変えようかな…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なな"}],"source"